footer Dipelihara di docs/diagram-uml, render dari sumber .puml
title Status tiket servis dan perpindahannya
[*] --> received : tiket dibuat
received --> diagnosing : mulai diagnosa
received --> cancelled : batal sebelum dikerjakan
diagnosing --> waiting_approval : butuh persetujuan biaya
diagnosing --> cancelled : batal saat diagnosa
waiting_approval --> in_progress : pelanggan setuju
waiting_approval --> cancelled : pelanggan menolak
in_progress --> testing : perbaikan selesai, siap uji
in_progress --> cancelled : batal saat dikerjakan
testing --> completed : lolos uji
testing --> in_progress : gagal uji, kerjakan ulang
testing --> cancelled : batal saat uji
completed --> picked_up : pelanggan melunasi dan mengambil unit
picked_up --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]
note right of cancelled
  cancelled boleh dari tahap mana pun sebelum completed.
  completed tidak bisa dibatalkan, hanya bisa diserahterimakan.
end note
@enduml
